in\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Lei Ma<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">The University of Tokyo &amp; University of Alberta</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Japan</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/tianyizhang1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Tianyi Zhang\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/tianyizhang1/be62b71d-f28d-4773-966a-4fe24d63b4bf/micro-avatar?1783981039000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Tianyi Zhang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Purdue University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>United States</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2025/icse-2025-research-track/208/Towards-Understanding-the-Characteristics-of-Code-Generation-Errors-Made-by-Large-Lan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-4b23f0ff-fbb4-4548-9574-772eab1fdb14').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
